{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/DecorationENG.png?t=1752354584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/DecorationHouse.gif?t=1752354584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Elevate your prestige by decorating your home with <strong>100 unique decor items</strong>. Reflect your personal style with paintings, furniture, and decorative accessories. Both market and home decorations directly influence your <strong>in-game prestige system !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/Products.png?t=1752354584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/Place_Products.gif?t=1752354584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Diversify your earnings by offering <strong>73 different products</strong> for sale. Showcase various product categories to expand your customer base and achieve <strong>maximum revenue potential</strong> through smart product placement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/WeatherEvents.png?t=1752354584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/Different_Seasons.gif?t=1752354584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Explore your game\u2019s dynamics with countless weather events across <strong>4 distinct seasons.</strong> Effects like <strong>snow, rain, and scorching heat</strong> can change everything from farming to trading. Each season brings <strong>new opportunities and challenges</strong>, injecting vibrancy into your game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/Farm.png?t=1752354584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/LastFarming.gif?t=1752354584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Diversify your farming by cultivating <strong>47 different products.</strong> Optimize processes such as <strong>seeding, irrigation, and harvesting</strong> to achieve <strong>maximum yield.</strong> Sell your crops at the markets for income or use them in various recipes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/DatesEvents.png?t=1752354584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/Different_Events.gif?t=1752354584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Enhance your game with events that occur on different dates. Whether tied to seasonal changes or special occasions, these events offer <strong>rare rewards and surprise opportunities.</strong> Stay active so you never miss out on any advantages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/animal.png?t=1752354584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/AnimalHusbandry.gif?t=1752354584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Obtain various products like <strong>milk, wool, eggs, and meat</strong> by raising <strong>3 different animal species.</strong> Increase your productivity by taking care of your <strong>animals\u2019 health and happiness.</strong> Sell the products you collect to generate income or incorporate them into your own production processes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/Quest.png?t=1752354584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/Quest_System.gif?t=1752354584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Shape your in-game relationships by completing tasks assigned by the <strong>kingdom, pirates, and the public.</strong> Each task has its own <strong>unique story and reward.</strong> These missions allow you to explore new regions and experience different narratives!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/QuestEND.png?t=1752354584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/Quest_End.gif?t=1752354584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 The choices you make in missions affect your relationships with the kingdom or other groups. Depending on your relationship level, different events and opportunities are triggered. Make <strong>strategic decisions</strong> to <strong>shape the world and narrative</strong> in the direction you desire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/1280x720-logo.png?t=1752354584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3391510?t=1752354584","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752354584","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/83ac5d85858fe690eeb3a19fc12e6254d2c04252/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752354584","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/83ac5d85858fe690eeb3a19fc12e6254d2c04252/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752354584","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3768650,"description":""},{"appid":3768650,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extras/oyun_steam_market2.png?t=1752354584\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391510/extra